<title>UK: SuedwestLB sets 300 mln mark bond due Dec 2003. [CORRECTED 13:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>SuedwestLB sets 300 mln mark bond due Dec 2003. [CORRECTED 13:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE CAPITAL MARKETS</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    23.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.52    PAY DATE  S-15.MAY.97</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects issue price from 101.27 to 101.52)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	REOFFER    99.57     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects full fees from 2.0 to 2.25)</p>
<p> NOTES    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    **	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   EURO</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.70	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND SEPTEMBER 2003 BUND</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
